{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mark's Power:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unusual adventure, you will play as space explorer Mark, who crashed on an unknown terrestrial planet. Get to know the locals, learn about their world order and try to repair your ship to return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/75fe4278d0e8fab5b24002018d043af5.avif?t=1772660199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is an adventure with elements of many genres. You will have to communicate with the locals, find resources, transform them, engage in trade and hire warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/05ac15ebc867549d7852275567630090.avif?t=1772660199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll find out why the locals don't use iron, what's hidden in the mysterious bunker, and who really rules this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/896353d5176e9689c3614fd976f0abb5.avif?t=1772660199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, defend your life in turn-based battles, and explore the nooks and crannies of a mysterious world. You will be given the opportunity to make some important choices that will affect the finale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/1faf841c394359d0147343d6720e8f5e.avif?t=1772660199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Many unique characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Strange jokes from a RoboFriend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Special trading system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Detailed locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Turn-based story battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 No grind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A kind story</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2768320?t=1772660199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772660199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/f1017360fa5db430cfd526a6481edc20f4a61f1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772660199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/f1017360fa5db430cfd526a6481edc20f4a61f1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772660199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2768330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mark's Power:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unusual adventure, you will play as space explorer Mark, who crashed on an unknown terrestrial planet. Get to know the locals, learn about their world order and try to repair your ship to return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/75fe4278d0e8fab5b24002018d043af5.avif?t=1772660199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is an adventure with elements of many genres. You will have to communicate with the locals, find resources, transform them, engage in trade and hire warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/05ac15ebc867549d7852275567630090.avif?t=1772660199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll find out why the locals don't use iron, what's hidden in the mysterious bunker, and who really rules this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/896353d5176e9689c3614fd976f0abb5.avif?t=1772660199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, defend your life in turn-based battles, and explore the nooks and crannies of a mysterious world. You will be given the opportunity to make some important choices that will affect the finale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/1faf841c394359d0147343d6720e8f5e.avif?t=1772660199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Many unique characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Strange jokes from a RoboFriend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Special trading system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Detailed locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Turn-based story battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 No grind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A kind story</p>","developers":["Dmitriy Zaletov"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/22d0641d5e929c28120a0a0a4b6e58a13e62bf91/header.jpg?t=1772660199","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"m